WEBVTT

00:10:56.076 --> 00:11:02.356
Now I want you to take out your phone
or whatever device you use, right now,

00:11:02.396 --> 00:11:05.596
and send that person just a little note.

00:11:06.356 --> 00:11:10.196
It could say, "I'm just thinking
of you and wanted to connect."

00:11:10.796 --> 00:11:15.116
Or you could say something more personal
to you and to your relationship.

00:11:16.156 --> 00:11:19.516
And then watch what comes back to you.

00:11:20.156 --> 00:11:22.356
And while we're here,

00:11:22.396 --> 00:11:25.156
we may even have time
to share with each other

00:11:25.196 --> 00:11:29.236
some of the responses
that people get when they do this.